Package: db.atlas
Title: Reusable Database Schema Metadata and Reports
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tchemit@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Extracts PostgreSQL schema metadata through application-supplied
    DBI connections, persists portable metadata snapshots, builds dependency
    models, and creates neutral HTML schema documentation and interactive
    dependency graphs. Database drivers and application branding remain the
    responsibility of consuming applications.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/db.atlas/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/db.atlas
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/db.atlas/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: data.table, DBI, DT, db.tools (>= 0.1.0), htmltools, htmlwidgets,
    visNetwork, whisker
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, RSQLite, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
Remotes: ultreia-io/db.tools
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/coverage: covr, xml2
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown, zip
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
